    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that formula makes sense, but i'm worried about cases where the supply side is the problem. sometimes we have the demand, but the shipments from shenzhen just don't show up when they're supposed to due to unexpected delays. how should i adjust the safety stock formula to protect against that kind of lead time variability?",
